{"id":80687110,"slug":"cant-find-a-psychiatrist-who-will","title":"Can’t Find a Psychiatrist Who Will See You in Network? Now, You Can Sue Your Company!","subtitle":"Legal updates mean the legal threat is increasing for employers.","post_date":"2023-06-24T22:11:00.798Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/cant-find-a-psychiatrist-who-will","wordcount":895,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:58:43.761Z","body_sha256":"74b955f806e013e35d75de6698a5afbff4f2c63cbe7accf36047eed2a257f626","text_words":1155,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p><em><strong>The Frontier Psychiatrists </strong>is a daily health-related newsletter. It has a humorous tone about serious issues. Owen Muir, M.D., writes most of it. Today—because it’s a lazy Saturday—we feature light reading about health insurance and compliance standards under ERISA!</em></p><div><hr></div><p>Guess what? Chicken butt. Guess why? Because there’s a regulatory compliance enforcement opportunity or disaster, depending on your perspective. Also, chicken thigh.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a></p><p>Do you know health insurance comes out of your paycheck <em>before</em> taxes? If you do have a job and it offers health benefits,  you have the option of health insurance.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> </p><p>It turns out that for employer-provided health insurance in the U.S. if your employer has to comply with ERISA<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-3\" href=\"#footnote-3\" target=\"_self\">3</a>, they have significant liability. As of 2021, Fiduciary Duty was definitively added to the Combined Appropriations Act.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg\" width=\"608\" height=\"455.16483516483515\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1090,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:608,&quot;bytes&quot;:3723465,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y0G6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05f68885-6acb-4fe4-9399-4a5ed3d35425_4032x3019.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Your Author Looks for Oranges In the Literal Hardware Store.</figcaption></figure></div><p><a href=\"https://www.dol.gov/general/topic/health-plans/fiduciaryresp\">What’s a fiduciary?</a> A fiduciary is someone who has to act in your best interest. This is defined financially. Your benefits can’t provide coverage <a href=\"https://www.kff.org/health-reform/issue-brief/network-adequacy-standards-and-enforcement/\">below minimum legal </a>standards when paying for health benefits. <a href=\"https://www.dol.gov/agencies/ebsa/about-ebsa/about-us/erisa-advisory-council/2010-employee-benefit-plan-auditing-and-financial-reporting-models\">The audit standards are laid out by the Department of Labor, which is helpfully accessible here.</a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share The Frontier Psychiatrists </span></a></p><p>Compliance with these laws is what makes health insurance pre-tax. It’s employment law. It’s tax law. It’s both. It’s the Pizza Hut and Taco Bell of legal statutes in the same convenient place!</p><div id=\"youtube2-EUP1xza23Z0\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;EUP1xza23Z0&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/EUP1xza23Z0?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><p>The health insurance business is <em>good</em> to be in…for payers:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y-XM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F660a1595-cde7-4cb5-aaae-094fe61627db_2612x2070.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y-XM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F660a1595-cde7-4cb5-aaae-094fe61627db_2612x2070.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y-XM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F660a1595-cde7-4cb5-aaae-094fe61627db_2612x2070.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y-XM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F660a1595-cde7-4cb5-aaae-094fe61627db_2612x2070.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y-XM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,